[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 13680.189, "timestamp": "03:48:00", "text": "几秒钟，但我还有12秒。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13686.79, "timestamp": "03:48:06", "text": "天哪，我的枪又回来了。我想要一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13710.469, "timestamp": "03:48:30", "text": "能。我的天啊。你要去……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13713.189, "timestamp": "03:48:33", "text": "然而，音速却如此之快。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13715.269, "timestamp": "03:48:35", "text": "不是。不，其实不是。实际上，我要走了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13730.229, "timestamp": "03:48:50", "text": "不，你属于中间立场。我无法推动"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13732.71, "timestamp": "03:48:52", "text": "向上。"}]